## Segmentation model (v4)

Pixel classification was performed with Trainable Weka Segmentation
(2D, grayscale) using the default feature set: Gaussian blur, Sobel,
Hessian, Difference of Gaussians and Membrane projections
(sigma 1–16, membrane patch size 19, thickness 1; 76 features).
Classifier: FastRandomForest (200 trees, 2 features per node,
unlimited depth, seed 439589309). Classes: `chromosomes`, `background`.
Model file: `fiji/models/classifier_v4.model`.

