## ROI extraction

Probability map → threshold [method/value] → binary mask → Close
([N] iterations) → Analyze Particles (size [min–max] px², circularity
[min–max]) → ROI Manager. Raw ROI counts (e.g. 37 for image 22) were
filtered to the counts used in downstream analysis (34 for image 22);
see `docs/roi_filtering.md`.
